WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.430
With Gancelot's skill, I add Blaster 
Blade to my hand from the deck.

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:08.280
Blaster Blade...

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:11.870
Do you remember this card?

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.840
Of course.

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:18.570
It was my former avatar, but I 
threw it away to become stronger.

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:20.550
Wrong.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:27.460
Then and now, your only avatar 
has been this Blaster Blade.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:33.660
Aichi, this time I'm going to teach you...

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:36.390
...what true strength is...

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.930
...and I'm going to stop you!

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:23.620
Do you intend to take that to him?

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:26.710
Yes. After all, he's an important customer.

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:28.530
He's strange...

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:32.510
Rekka, he's a fighter that 
was chosen by Psyqualia.

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:34.200
You mustn't forget that.

00:02:34.790 --> 00:02:36.570
Right...

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.010
Please.

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:41.800
Thank you.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:47.210
It's good.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.140
Well, that's nice to hear.

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:52.300
I have to show my appreciation to you.

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:54.580
All right, then...

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:59.830
Since I'm here, how about this?

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:01.800
Excuse me?

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:24.060
You're clerks at the mystery card shop PSY...

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:27.550
...and yet members of the up-and-coming 
idol group, Ultra-rare.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:31.540
I don't know what your aim is...

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:34.900
...but I'm grateful to you 
for this wonderful power.

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:39.020
If you feel gratitude, please show it to <i>him</i>.

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:40.390
S-Suiko!

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:43.880
Who are you referring to?

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:46.600
I'm sure you'll meet him soon...

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.140
I'm sure...

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:50.400
Is that right?

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:53.690
Then I'm looking forward to it.

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:00.160
It seems the person you're 
waiting for is late.

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:02.040
That's okay.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:04.790
He'll come.

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:07.740
Led by the power of Psyqualia...

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:14.000
Beyond the Battle

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.540
Marron attacks.

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:36.280
I attack with Young Pegasus 
Knight, boosted by Flogal!

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:39.240
No guard!

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:44.060
Check the drive trigger...

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:52.620
It's my turn. I draw.

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:58.540
Blaster Blade, my avatar? Wrong, Kai.

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:01.220
It's certainly not my avatar now...

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:06.480
Annihilate everything, my avatar!

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.620
I ride Blaster Dark!

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:19.320
Counterblast!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:34.410
I call Knight of Darkness, 
Rugos and Blaster Javelin!

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.400
I activate Javelin's skill!

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:47.540
I'm adding Phantom Blaster Dragon to my hand.

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:51.030
And then I attack with Blaster Dark!

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:55.300
No guard.

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:56.940
Check!

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:00.350
Critical trigger.

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:02.440
I give the power to Rugos...

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:05.270
...and the extra critical to Blaster Dark!

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:16.080
Rugos attacks with a boost from Javelin!

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:18.800
No guard!

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:28.030
Check the damage trigger.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:30.810
Got a heal trigger.

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:38.230
If he hadn't healed now, that would've 
been 3 damage just from this turn!

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:40.080
Aichi really is strong!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:43.040
So what are you gonna do, Kai?

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.490
Stand and draw.

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:49.380
Remember, Aichi...

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:54.070
This is... your true avatar!

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:57.300
I ride Blaster Blade!

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:11.920
Blaster Blade's Counterblast!

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:14.850
Begone, Rugos!

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.830
I move Marron.

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.560
Then I call Knight of Truth, Gordon.

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.180
With a boost from Flogal...

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:31.690
...Blaster Blade attacks!

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:36.200
Protect me, Grim Reaper!

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:40.390
Check the drive trigger.

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:44.200
Got one. I add +5000 to the power of Gordon.

00:07:57.230 --> 00:07:58.830
With a boost from Marron...

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.290
...Gordon attacks!

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:05.120
Draw trigger.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:10.330
From here on in, I'm going to show 
you the true terror of my deck!

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:13.850
Here I go! Stand and draw!

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:21.260
Cursed dragon, come out and 
muster your dark power!

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:22.300
I ride...

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:26.400
...Phantom Blaster Dragon!

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:37.320
Brother...

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:42.020
I call Dark Mage, Badhabh Caar.

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:45.540
With his skill, I turn over 
the top card of my deck.

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:49.290
If that card is a Shadow 
Paladin, I can call it.

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:54.650
I'll bet <i>only</i> Shadow Paladins 
are in Brother's deck!

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:57.190
Then it just depends on 
which card he draws...

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:02.590
A second Blaster Dark!

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:08.510
That's my avatar. You never fail me.

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:11.780
Where there is light, there is darkness.

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:15.040
Light can only be swallowed up by darkness...

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:19.040
Appear from the everlasting 
darkness, Dark Spirit...

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:21.030
Blaster Dark!

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.090
I call Doranbau.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:31.850
I attack Blaster Blade with 
Badhabh Caar, boosted by Javelin!

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:42.580
I attack with Phantom Blaster Dragon!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.120
I guard with Epona!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.710
Drive trigger check.

00:09:58.090 --> 00:09:59.420
Heal trigger!

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:02.510
I add +5000 to the power of Blaster Dark.

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:06.100
I heal my damage.

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:12.980
I attack with Blaster 
Dark, boosted by Doranbau!

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:17.160
With Doranbau's skill, Blaster 
Dark gains +4000 power!

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:22.630
No guard!

00:10:43.570 --> 00:10:45.590
2 damage in just this turn...

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:48.780
Even though he's obviously inferior to me...

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.540
...he's still looking at me like that!

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:54.300
I stand and draw.

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:58.390
Enter the fray, king of all knights!

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:00.360
King of Knights, Alfred!

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:15.800
Come, Knight of Silence, Gallatin and Wingal!

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:24.720
I've gotten stronger.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:27.040
I'm not the same person that I was long ago.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.780
I'll make you understand that this turn!

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:33.910
I attack with Gordon, boosted by Marron!

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:36.870
No guard.

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:44.430
Alfred!

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:45.740
No guard!

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:48.380
Check the drive trigger.

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:02.300
With a boost from Wingal... Gallatin!

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:04.870
No guard!

00:12:18.390 --> 00:12:20.330
Now do you understand, Kai?

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:24.050
No matter how much you 
attack, it won't faze me.

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:26.330
After all, I can see...

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:30.020
...how this fight is going to end.

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:33.510
I can see my victory.

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:39.840
So, let me tell you something.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:41.920
This is my...

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:43.360
Final Turn!

00:12:44.100 --> 00:12:46.100
I call Skull Witch, Nemain!

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:51.950
I activate her skill!

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:55.900
I drop one card and draw two cards!

00:12:57.390 --> 00:13:00.630
Then, Phantom Blaster Dragon's...

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.790
Damned Charging Lance!

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:05.870
Badhabh Caar! Blaster Javelin! Nemain!

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:08.930
Sacrifice yourselves to the cursed dragon!

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:25.150
Dark Metal Dragon, Witch of Nostrum, Arianrhod,
 and Black Sage, Charon, come!

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:35.390
Go, Dark Metal Dragon, with 
a boost from Arianrhod!

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:40.990
No guard.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.230
That brings him up to 5 damage...

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:51.320
End of the line.

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:57.090
Even though I've got the 
overwhelming advantage...

00:13:57.540 --> 00:14:00.170
...how can he look at me like that?

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:06.090
Kai, do you still think I'm weak?

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:14.180
Why? Why won't you understand?!

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:17.520
I'm strong! I got strong!

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:19.260
With a boost from Charon...

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:22.580
Go, Phantom Blaster Dragon!

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:28.880
I guard with Future Knight, 
Llew, Flogal and Margal!

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:43.540
Drive trigger check!

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:48.520
Critical trigger!

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:51.050
But only with one card.

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:54.590
Even if he adds the effects to Phantom 
Blaster, the attack won't go through.

00:14:55.470 --> 00:15:00.320
In that case, I give all of Grim 
Reaper's effects to Blaster Dark!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:13.470
All right! He pulled through!

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:16.010
He's got one final attack.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:18.130
Doranbau boosts!

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:20.330
Go, Blaster Dark!

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:30.950
Now you'll admit that I've 
gotten strong, right?!

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:33.430
To fight you!

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.690
Come on, look, Kai!

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:38.330
This is my power!

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:41.120
I guard with Marron!

00:15:44.030 --> 00:15:45.820
And I intercept with Gordon.

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:49.110
I activate his skill. His shield gains +5000!

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:53.290
No...

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:56.720
My Final Turn is...

00:15:57.980 --> 00:15:58.980
Why?

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:03.440
Why didn't it happen like the cards told me?!

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:07.190
This isn't the way I pictured it!

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:11.240
That's why I say you're weak, Aichi.

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:12.780
Why?!

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:16.620
After I worked so hard 
to be able to fight you!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:20.550
Even without you, I've 
been winning at nationals!

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:22.610
Even against the Jurassic Army!

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:25.490
Even against those Brilliant Stars!

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:32.360
What you call strength, relying on that 
Psyqualia power you have, isn't the real thing!

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:36.390
I'm going to show you what real strength is.

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:38.590
Final Turn!

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:44.910
Together with the knights, open a path...

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:47.390
...and look upon the young king!

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.730
Ride the Vanguard!

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:51.700
Alfred Early!

00:16:58.260 --> 00:17:01.480
Alfred Early?! Then...

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:03.680
I activate his skill!

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:07.400
I Superior Call Blaster Blade from the Soul!

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:11.030
Blaster Blade...

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:17.710
Picture it.

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:25.290
We're astral bodies that have just appeared 
on Cray, a planet very much like Earth.

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:32.510
Remember, Aichi Sendou...

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:37.520
Remember the power that you showed when 
you were on the verge of losing me.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:43.260
You stood up to your classmate...

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:49.320
Morikawa, please! That card's 
very important to me!

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:53.190
What's lost in a Vanguard fight can only 
be regained through a Vanguard fight.

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:57.860
T-Then, will you fight me?

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:00.860
Sure, I'm game.

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:04.760
Remember the courage you showed when 
you challenged Toshiki Kai to a fight!

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:09.840
<i>Those</i> things are the 
strength you've always had!

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:14.320
The strength I've always had...?

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:16.200
That's right.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:20.290
You always hid behind someone,

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:21.560
didn't stand out,

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:23.650
ran away quickly if anything happened...

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:26.430
That's the way you used to live...

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:31.700
...but now you're winning your way to 
the finals of the national tournament.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:35.480
That isn't because of the level 
of perfection of your deck,

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:39.060
much less the power of Psyqualia!

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:42.570
No! You're wrong!

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:45.060
It's all because of Psyqualia!

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:47.590
Without this power, I...

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:49.520
Is that really so?

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:54.050
Didn't you want to fight me...

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:58.900
...<i>before</i> you obtained that power?

00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:04.390
Remember, Aichi!

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:06.760
Remember the fight you really wanted to have!

00:19:07.590 --> 00:19:11.210
The fight I really wanted to have...

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:24.170
Kai!

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:28.650
I've been dreaming for the longest time...

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:31.080
...of fighting you like this!

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:42.720
I see... That's right.

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:51.040
What?!

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:54.620
I'm sorry, Blaster Dark.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:58.090
But I've realized...

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:01.600
You'll regret it.

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:10.180
No. I won't. I'm sure of it.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.780
After all, my avatar is...

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:19.190
Let's go, Blaster Blade.

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:32.840
No. Not this.

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:38.150
This isn't the fight that 
I wanted to have with Kai!

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:53.160
Aichi...

00:20:54.990 --> 00:20:56.020
Kai...

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:59.120
Take this. It's your deck.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:19.330
Well, I guess this counts as a happy ending?

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:35.300
It seems Aichi Sendou chose Team Q4.

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:38.130
It's too bad.

00:21:38.510 --> 00:21:41.580
In the end, I guess he 
wasn't much of a fighter.

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:46.850
Right? Boring, isn't it?

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:54.340
Just keep grinning and bearing it!

00:21:54.340 --> 00:21:55.550
Stop it.

00:21:59.390 --> 00:22:02.850
Ren Suzugamori and Aichi Sendou...

00:22:05.750 --> 00:22:08.200
They both have Psyqualia, but now...

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:10.880
...they're walking down separate paths.

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:16.650
I'm looking forward to the 
finals tournament, you know?

00:23:51.040 --> 00:23:52.180
Brother!

00:23:52.180 --> 00:23:52.960
Yo!

00:23:52.960 --> 00:23:54.640
Everyone, um...

00:23:54.640 --> 00:23:56.990
That's right! The Manager said...

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:58.900
Yay! The shop tournament, right?!

00:23:58.900 --> 00:24:01.930
Yep. Maybe I'll participate 
again this time, too...

00:24:01.930 --> 00:24:05.130
Thank you for worrying about me.

00:24:05.130 --> 00:24:07.030
Everyone... I'm sorry!

00:24:07.560 --> 00:24:09.740
Next time: Golden Glow.

00:24:10.860 --> 00:24:14.790
Um, er, my ability to 
imagine couldn't keep up...

00:24:14.790 --> 00:24:17.260
It's okay. We all feel the same way.

00:24:17.260 --> 00:24:18.390
Right, right...
